<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.bundle.backs-up ~ one face, carried off the vessel as a sealed bundle

`lares vault backup face=<N> out=<file>` asks the standing vessel to seal face hN's body, binds the bundle's routes and writes it to a file that must not yet stand. Indices print under `lares persona list`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ backup

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`backup` params=`face/2 out/h2.bundle ~ seal face h2 into a bundle file`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · out

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index needs/required ~ the face to carry off, by persona index`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path needs/required ~ the bundle file, which must not yet stand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/route ~ a person types the bundle's route at their own terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · no-vessel · daemon-unreachable · out-exists · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.bundle.backs-up face/2 out/h2.bundle]] ~ name the face's index and the file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`no-vessel` params=`~ no vessel stands on this store`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-unreachable` params=`cure/[[face.bundle.backs-up face/2 out/h2.bundle]] ~ the vessel stopped answering`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`out-exists` params=`~ a file already stands at out=`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the custody door's named refusals lead the line by class (OccupiedStoreRefusal, CustodyRefusal, TreeKeyRefusal, CensusRefusal, CustodyLockRefused, CustodyFoundingRefused, CredentialTtyRefusal, RotationSlotsRefused), exit 1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ written

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`written` params=`exit/0 ~ the bundle landed; the lines name the file and its routes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares vault backup

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares vault backup]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

